        rdfs:label "PlanformDB planarian morphology animation faithfully reproduces Planaria (Schmidtea mediterranea, Dugesia japonica) morphology" ;
        dcterms:description "The simulation script(s) 1900-planformDB_parser.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Planaria (Schmidtea mediterranea, Dugesia japonica) specimens and the source authors' figures." ;
